  "description": "Emitted when the sender resolves an open dispute. `accept = true` refunds the bond to the recipient and unwinds the stream pro-rata (a `StreamCancelled` event accompanies it); `accept = false` treats the dispute as bad-faith and slashes the bond to the sender, resuming the stream normally.",
